console: /help
console:   Commands: help time weather gamemode difficulty tp give summon kill clear effect xp locate seed spawnpoint setblock vessel
console:   Tab completes names; arrow keys recall earlier commands.
console: /time set noon
console:   Set the time to 6000
console: /give diamond sword 1
console:   Gave 1 [Titanium Sword] to Player
console: /give powderwight-head
console:   Gave 1 [Powderwight Head] to Player
console: /locate sea temple
console:   Unknown structure sea_temple
console: /summon powderwight
console:   Summoned new Powderwight
console: <Player> hello
console: /tp ~ ~2 ~
console:   Teleported Player to 8.5, 88.0, 8.5
console: /bogus
console:   Unknown command: bogus. Type /help for a list
console: /bases
console:   Greywall Base: -408 ~ 241 (476 blocks), marked on your map
console:   Capital Citadel: -456 ~ 972 (1069 blocks), marked on your map
console:   Meridian Frigate: 592 ~ 909 (1073 blocks, patrols)
console:   Capital City: -743 ~ -887 (1169 blocks), marked on your map
console:   Boreal Station: 1203 ~ 168 (1205 blocks), marked on your map
console:   Train: -944 ~ -784 (1239 blocks, on the Cedar & Gold Western)
console:   Siege Carriage: 6422 ~ 545 (6435 blocks, patrols)
console:   Ironback Crawler: -7607 ~ -1666 (7797 blocks, patrols)
console:   The Stormwarden Frigates sail once a Greywall Fortress falls
console: /rare
console:   Sealed Armoury: 24 ~ 24 (21 blocks, underground: its floor at y -29, 102 blocks under the surface), marked on your map
console:   Trail Ruins: -418 ~ -510 (671 blocks), marked on your map
console:   Marauder Watchtower: 632 ~ 328 (700 blocks), marked on your map
console:   Sunken Dreadnought: 278 ~ 744 (783 blocks, on the sea floor 10 blocks down), marked on your map
console:   Temple: -920 ~ -767 (1209 blocks), marked on your map
console:   Brigand Roost: -5400 ~ -7439 (9204 blocks), marked on your map
console:   There is no Ancient Spire in this world
console:   There is no Buried Citadel in this world
console: suggestions military_base
